              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>The US and Hamas held their first direct talks since the Gaza ceasefire, as efforts to move the fragile truce forward stalled.</strong> US adviser Aryeh Lightstone met Hamas negotiator Khalil al-Hayya in Cairo, with discussions focused on Israel’s phase-one commitments, including halting strikes and allowing more aid, alongside Hamas disarmament, an international force, and an Israeli withdrawal from Gaza (<a href="https://www.firstpost.com/world/us-and-hamas-hold-first-direct-talks-since-gaza-ceasefire-report-14001013.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">truce deadlock</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Germany’s far-right AfD pledged a manifesto packed with hardline promises ahead of September’s Saxony-Anhalt election.</strong> The party backs “remigration,” mass deportations, and a sharp anti-immigration shift, while also calling for Russian language lessons and an end to sanctions on Moscow. The proposals underscore AfD’s shift from fringe movement to a serious political force reshaping Germany’s debate (<a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/04/15/europe/alternative-for-deutschland-afd-germany-manifesto-intl" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">far-right manifesto</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>An NY jury found that Ticketmaster and its parent company, Live Nation, held illegal monopolies in key US live-event markets. </strong>The verdict follows allegations that the company used its power over venues and artists to overcharge fans. Live Nation now faces potential penalties, including forced divestiture and damages sought by states (<a href="https://www.jpost.com/international/article-893172" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">antitrust blow</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Cadence Design Systems and Nvidia are partnering to speed up AI development for robotics.</strong> The companies will combine Cadence’s physics engines with Nvidia’s AI models to train robots in simulation, reducing dependence on real-world testing. The collaboration aims to speed up robot training through more accurate virtual environments (<a href="https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/international-business/article-nvidia-cadence-design-systems-developing-ai-robotics/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">robot training</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Monarch Tractor’s collapse has ended with its assets acquired by Caterpillar, closing a turbulent chapter for the startup.</strong> Founded in 2018 to build autonomous electric tractors, Monarch raised more than $200M but later faced layoffs, dealer lawsuits, and the loss of its manufacturing partner. The agreement follows a failed pivot to software and growing doubts over the company’s core technology (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/15/monarch-tractors-collapse-ends-in-with-an-acquisition-by-caterpillar/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">startup shutdown</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Google has launched a native Gemini app for macOS, bringing its AI assistant directly to Mac users.</strong> The app enables quick access via shortcuts, real-time screen sharing for contextual help, and support for analyzing files, charts, and documents. It also includes image and video generation tools, expanding Gemini’s capabilities across productivity and creative tasks (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/15/google-rolls-out-a-native-gemini-app-for-mac/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Gemini hits Mac</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>A long-term study has found that staying mentally active throughout life may help reduce the risk of Alzheimer’s by 38%.</strong> Researchers found that people who regularly read, write, learn languages, and stay intellectually engaged developed the disease later than those with the lowest mental stimulation. The findings suggest lifelong learning may support brain health, though the study shows association, not proof (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/04/260414075648.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">brain health boost</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Mark Mobius, 'Indiana Jones of emerging markets,' dies at 89 (<a href="https://www.livemint.com/news/world/mark-mobius-dies-at-89-why-he-was-known-as-the-indiana-jones-of-emerging-markets-11776301229999.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">investing pioneer dies</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Scientists identify a breakthrough method to block a virus carried by 95% globally (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/04/260414075650.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">virus halt</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">A Chinese man was jailed for smuggling over 2,200 live ants (<a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/04/15/africa/chinese-man-smuggle-ants-kenya-intl-scli" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">ant trafficking</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
